  (text "Power notes:\n- J1: 12 V, 5.5x2.1 mm, centre positive. Q1 blocks reverse polarity; D1 clamps Q1 Vgs to 15 V.\n- D2 SMAJ16A clamps surges (26 V max) below DRV8316 40 V abs max and TPS54202 30 V abs max.\n- U1 TPS54202: 12 V -> 5.08 V (100k / 13.3k, 75 pF feedforward per TI Table 7-2). EN floats = enabled.\n- D3/D4 diode-OR: USB VBUS or +5V_BUCK -> +5V -> U2 AP2112 -> +3V3 (MCU, encoder, header).\n- VM_SENSE = VM x 10/110 (12 V -> 1.09 V at GPIO7)."
    (at 81.28 101.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f6fbcb3c-d427-4a64-b269-1ff2e4e0879d")
  )
